# Blueprint — layers

```
page.tsx → frontend/features → frontend/gateway → api/route (AdminApiHandler)
  → domains/.../services → *.repo → Drizzle → Postgres
```

| Layer | Owns | Never |
|-------|------|-------|
| Route | Handler options, one service call, `HandlerResults` | Queries, policies, business logic |
| Service | One intent; policy; model rules; orchestration | HTTP, Zod, status codes |
| Policy | Who may act (`boolean`) | I/O, state rules |
| Model | Field behavior; relations via explicit `repos` args | Db handle, lazy load |
| Repo | One table; `toModel`; unique → `ConflictError` | Business decisions |
| View | Model → DTO | Business rules |

**Exports:** one PascalCase object per module (`export const UpdateInstitution = { call }`). Suffixes: `.model`, `.repo`, `.policy`, `.errors`, `.service`, `.validation`, `.view`.

**Services:** `call(repos: AppRepos, actor: Actor, input)` — receive repos from the handler, never open a db client.

**Routes:** see route template in `AGENTS.md`. **Tests:** AAA with blank lines; integration file mirrors `route.ts` path under `tests/integration/`.
